window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a417-228bc6ba65565eea.json"]={sha256:"228bc6ba65565eea396e63d52b517a0f6aae71450035e505a0f26183f48cfd6c",value:{"id":"a417","title":"超穎透鏡製程研究","titleEn":"Metalens fabrication research","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 532 nm、NA 0.8 的 TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎透鏡為主線，從廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣出發，解釋奈米柱如何在 600 nm 高度內覆蓋 2π 相位，再比較電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機的解析度與產能，最後把蝕刻側壁、關鍵尺寸均勻性、色差與拼接誤差整合成可量測的聚焦效率與 Strehl 預算。","summaryEn":"Using a 532 nm, NA 0.8 TiO₂ nanopillar metalens as the running case, the course starts from the generalized Snell law and phase sampling, shows how pillars cover 2π of phase within 600 nm of height, compares electron-beam direct write with DUV steppers for resolution and throughput, then folds etch sidewalls, critical-dimension uniformity, chromatic focal shift and field stitching into a measurable focusing-efficiency and Strehl budget.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-coatings-elements","subcategoryTitle":"薄膜、繞射與微結構光學元件","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coatings, diffractive and structured optical elements","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-coatings-elements","learningTags":["optics","optics-coatings-elements","coating"],"architectureFamily":"coating","architectureNodes":[["相位設計與超穎原子庫","Phase design and meta-atom library"],["EBL 或 DUV 曝光","EBL or DUV exposure"],["ALD 填充與乾蝕刻","ALD fill and dry etch"],["基板與背面增透層","Substrate and backside AR layer"],["焦點效率與 PSF 量測","Focusing-efficiency and PSF metrology"],["模組整合與驗收","Module integration and acceptance"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[2,4],[0,4],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"coating","labels":["相位設計與超穎原子庫","EBL 或 DUV 曝光","ALD 填充與乾蝕刻","基板與背面增透層","焦點效率與 PSF 量測"],"labelsEn":["Phase design and meta-atom library","EBL or DUV exposure","ALD fill and dry etch","Substrate and backside AR layer","Focusing-efficiency and PSF metrology"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：λ = 532 nm、直徑 D = 2 mm、f = 0.75 mm 的 TiO₂ 超穎透鏡，NA = sin(atan(1/0.75)) = 0.8。菲涅耳圈數 N = (√(R² + f²) − f)/λ = (1.25 − 0.75) mm/0.532 µm ≈ 940 圈；最外圈寬 λ/NA = 665 nm，以 250 nm 格點取樣得每圈 2.66 個超穎原子，純量估計邊緣局部效率 sinc²(1/2.66) ≈ 0.61。柱子總數 π(1000 µm)²/(0.25 µm)² ≈ 5.0×10⁷ 根。EBL 以 1000 µC/cm²、1 nA、填充率 35% 寫入需 t = 1.1×10⁻² cm² × 10⁻³ C/cm² / 10⁻⁹ A ≈ 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h。景深 λ/NA² ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移動一個景深對應 Δλ ≈ 0.59 nm，故只適合窄線寬雷射。CD 標準差 3 nm 經 0.052 rad/nm 換算得 σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad，Strehl ≈ 0.976。數值皆為教學假設。","textEn":"Design exercise: a TiO₂ metalens with λ = 532 nm, diameter D = 2 mm and f = 0.75 mm has NA = sin(atan(1/0.75)) = 0.8. The number of Fresnel zones is N = (√(R² + f²) − f)/λ = (1.25 − 0.75) mm/0.532 µm ≈ 940; the outermost zone is λ/NA = 665 nm wide, sampled by 2.66 meta-atoms on a 250 nm lattice, giving a scalar local rim efficiency of sinc²(1/2.66) ≈ 0.61. The pillar count is π(1000 µm)²/(0.25 µm)² ≈ 5.0×10⁷. EBL at 1000 µC/cm², 1 nA and 35% fill takes t = 1.1×10⁻² cm² × 10⁻³ C/cm² / 10⁻⁹ A ≈ 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h. The depth of focus λ/NA² ≈ 0.83 µm, so moving the focus by one depth of focus needs only Δλ ≈ 0.59 nm, which restricts use to narrow-linewidth lasers. A 3 nm CD standard deviation through 0.052 rad/nm gives σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad and Strehl ≈ 0.976. All values are teaching assumptions.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a417-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」與「超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\" and \"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a417-v12-01","title":"廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"超穎透鏡不靠厚度累積光程，而是在一層次波長的奈米結構上逐點指定穿透相位。要把平面波聚到焦距 f，相位剖面必須是 φ(r) = −(2π/λ)(√(r² + f²) − f)，其徑向梯度 dφ/dr = −(2π/λ)·sinθ 就是廣義 Snell 定律中的面內波向量，透鏡邊緣的 sinθ 即數值孔徑 NA。相位以週期 p 的格點離散取樣，格點既要細到能解析邊緣最陡的相位斜率，又要小於基板內波長以免格點本身繞射。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A metalens does not accumulate optical path through thickness; it assigns a transmission phase point by point on a single subwavelength-structured layer. To focus a plane wave at distance f the phase must follow φ(r) = −(2π/λ)(√(r² + f²) − f), whose radial gradient dφ/dr = −(2π/λ)·sinθ is the in-plane wavevector of the generalized Snell law, and sinθ at the rim equals the numerical aperture. The phase is sampled on a lattice of pitch p that must resolve the steepest slope at the rim yet stay below the wavelength inside the substrate so that the lattice itself does not diffract. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：最外圈局部週期 Λ = λ/NA；Nyquist 要求 p ≤ λ/(2·NA)，λ = 532 nm、NA = 0.8 時 p ≤ 332 nm；另需 p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm 避免熔融石英內的格點繞射。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The local period at the rim is Λ = λ/NA; Nyquist requires p ≤ λ/(2·NA), i.e. p ≤ 332 nm for λ = 532 nm and NA = 0.8, and p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm avoids lattice diffraction inside fused silica.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-01-k1","title":"廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣","titleEn":"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling","text":"超穎透鏡不靠厚度累積光程，而是在一層次波長的奈米結構上逐點指定穿透相位。要把平面波聚到焦距 f，相位剖面必須是 φ(r) = −(2π/λ)(√(r² + f²) − f)，其徑向梯度 dφ/dr = −(2π/λ)·sinθ 就是廣義 Snell 定律中的面內波向量，透鏡邊緣的 sinθ 即數值孔徑 NA。","textEn":"A metalens does not accumulate optical path through thickness; it assigns a transmission phase point by point on a single subwavelength-structured layer. To focus a plane wave at distance f the phase must follow φ(r) = −(2π/λ)(√(r² + f²) − f), whose radial gradient dφ/dr = −(2π/λ)·sinθ is the in-plane wavevector of the generalized Snell law, and sinθ at the rim equals the numerical aperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\" is correct?","options":["只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","超穎透鏡不靠厚度累積光程，而是在一層次波長的奈米結構上逐點指定穿透相位。","奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","A metalens does not accumulate optical path through thickness; it assigns a transmission phase point by point on a single subwavelength-structured layer.","Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"超穎透鏡不靠厚度累積光程，而是在一層次波長的奈米結構上逐點指定穿透相位。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A metalens does not accumulate optical path through thickness; it assigns a transmission phase point by point on a single subwavelength-structured layer. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a417-v12-02","title":"廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣：定量估算","titleEn":"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：最外圈局部週期 Λ = λ/NA；Nyquist 要求 p ≤ λ/(2·NA)，λ = 532 nm、NA = 0.8 時 p ≤ 332 nm；另需 p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm 避免熔融石英內的格點繞射。取 p = 250 nm，最外圈 Λ = 665 nm 只被 2.66 個超穎原子取樣。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The local period at the rim is Λ = λ/NA; Nyquist requires p ≤ λ/(2·NA), i.e. p ≤ 332 nm for λ = 532 nm and NA = 0.8, and p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm avoids lattice diffraction inside fused silica. With p = 250 nm the outermost period Λ = 665 nm is sampled by only 2.66 meta-atoms. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用設計檔計算每個半徑的相位梯度與每週期取樣數，畫成 r 的函數；再以 FDTD 或 RCWA 對邊緣一個局部光柵週期算繞射效率，與 sinc²(1/N) 的純量估計比較，確認邊緣效率下降量是否在聚焦效率預算內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: From the layout, compute the phase gradient and samples per period as a function of radius; then simulate one local grating period at the rim with FDTD or RCWA and compare its diffraction efficiency with the scalar sinc²(1/N) estimate to confirm that the rim loss fits the focusing-efficiency budget.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"最外圈局部週期 Λ = λ/NA；Nyquist 要求 p ≤ λ/(2·NA)，λ = 532 nm、NA = 0.8 時 p ≤ 332 nm；另需 p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm 避免熔融石英內的格點繞射。取 p = 250 nm，最外圈 Λ = 665 nm 只被 2.66 個超穎原子取樣。","textEn":"The local period at the rim is Λ = λ/NA; Nyquist requires p ≤ λ/(2·NA), i.e. p ≤ 332 nm for λ = 532 nm and NA = 0.8, and p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm avoids lattice diffraction inside fused silica. With p = 250 nm the outermost period Λ = 665 nm is sampled by only 2.66 meta-atoms.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\", which statement holds?","options":["只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。","超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。","最外圈局部週期 Λ = λ/NA。"],"optionsEn":["If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.","A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.","The local period at the rim is Λ = λ/NA."],"answer":2,"explanation":"最外圈局部週期 Λ = λ/NA；Nyquist 要求 p ≤ λ/(2·NA)，λ = 532 nm、NA = 0.8 時 p ≤ 332 nm；另需 p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm 避免熔融石英內的格點繞射。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The local period at the rim is Λ = λ/NA; Nyquist requires p ≤ λ/(2·NA), i.e. p ≤ 332 nm for λ = 532 nm and NA = 0.8, and p \u003c λ/n_sub = 532/1.46 ≈ 364 nm avoids lattice diffraction inside fused silica. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a417-v12-03","title":"廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用設計檔計算每個半徑的相位梯度與每週期取樣數，畫成 r 的函數；再以 FDTD 或 RCWA 對邊緣一個局部光柵週期算繞射效率，與 sinc²(1/N) 的純量估計比較，確認邊緣效率下降量是否在聚焦效率預算內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"From the layout, compute the phase gradient and samples per period as a function of radius; then simulate one local grating period at the rim with FDTD or RCWA and compare its diffraction efficiency with the scalar sinc²(1/N) estimate to confirm that the rim loss fits the focusing-efficiency budget. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了追求高 NA 而讓邊緣每週期取樣數掉到 2 以下時，外圈能量進入其他繞射級，表現為焦點周圍的環狀背景與聚焦效率隨 NA 急遽下降，而中心區量測仍看似正常。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Pushing NA until the rim falls below two samples per period sends outer-zone energy into other diffraction orders, seen as a ring-shaped background around the focus and a sharp drop in focusing efficiency with NA, while the central zone still measures normally.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用設計檔計算每個半徑的相位梯度與每週期取樣數，畫成 r 的函數；再以 FDTD 或 RCWA 對邊緣一個局部光柵週期算繞射效率，與 sinc²(1/N) 的純量估計比較，確認邊緣效率下降量是否在聚焦效率預算內。","textEn":"From the layout, compute the phase gradient and samples per period as a function of radius; then simulate one local grating period at the rim with FDTD or RCWA and compare its diffraction efficiency with the scalar sinc²(1/N) estimate to confirm that the rim loss fits the focusing-efficiency budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\"?","options":["用設計檔計算每個半徑的相位梯度與每週期取樣數，畫成 r 的函數。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。"],"optionsEn":["From the layout, compute the phase gradient and samples per period as a function of radius.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用設計檔計算每個半徑的相位梯度與每週期取樣數，畫成 r 的函數；再以 FDTD 或 RCWA 對邊緣一個局部光柵週期算繞射效率，與 sinc²(1/N) 的純量估計比較，確認邊緣效率下降量是否在聚焦效率預算內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"From the layout, compute the phase gradient and samples per period as a function of radius; then simulate one local grating period at the rim with FDTD or RCWA and compare its diffraction efficiency with the scalar sinc²(1/N) estimate to confirm that the rim loss fits the focusing-efficiency budget. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a417-v12-04","title":"廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣：失效診斷","titleEn":"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了追求高 NA 而讓邊緣每週期取樣數掉到 2 以下時，外圈能量進入其他繞射級，表現為焦點周圍的環狀背景與聚焦效率隨 NA 急遽下降，而中心區量測仍看似正常。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Pushing NA until the rim falls below two samples per period sends outer-zone energy into other diffraction orders, seen as a ring-shaped background around the focus and a sharp drop in focusing efficiency with NA, while the central zone still measures normally. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：相位以週期 p 的格點離散取樣，格點既要細到能解析邊緣最陡的相位斜率，又要小於基板內波長以免格點本身繞射。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The phase is sampled on a lattice of pitch p that must resolve the steepest slope at the rim yet stay below the wavelength inside the substrate so that the lattice itself does not diffract.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了追求高 NA 而讓邊緣每週期取樣數掉到 2 以下時，外圈能量進入其他繞射級，表現為焦點周圍的環狀背景與聚焦效率隨 NA 急遽下降，而中心區量測仍看似正常。","textEn":"Pushing NA until the rim falls below two samples per period sends outer-zone energy into other diffraction orders, seen as a ring-shaped background around the focus and a sharp drop in focusing efficiency with NA, while the central zone still measures normally.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","為了追求高 NA 而讓邊緣每週期取樣數掉到 2 以下時，外圈能量進入其他繞射級，表現為焦點周圍的環狀背景與聚焦效率隨 NA 急遽下降，而中心區量測仍看似正常。","奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Pushing NA until the rim falls below two samples per period sends outer-zone energy into other diffraction orders, seen as a ring-shaped background around the focus and a sharp drop in focusing efficiency with NA, while the central zone still measures normally.","Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"為了追求高 NA 而讓邊緣每週期取樣數掉到 2 以下時，外圈能量進入其他繞射級，表現為焦點周圍的環狀背景與聚焦效率隨 NA 急遽下降，而中心區量測仍看似正常。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Pushing NA until the rim falls below two samples per period sends outer-zone energy into other diffraction orders, seen as a ring-shaped background around the focus and a sharp drop in focusing efficiency with NA, while the central zone still measures normally. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a417-v12-05","title":"超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每根 TiO₂ 奈米柱是一段截斷的介電波導，直徑決定基模有效折射率 n_eff，穿透相位約為 (2π/λ)·n_eff·h。直徑從約 80 nm 增到 200 nm 時，532 nm 波長下 n_eff 約從 1.1 升到 2.1，因此固定高度 h 的柱子只靠直徑就能掃過 2π。另一條路是幾何相位：把柱子做成半波片並旋轉角度 θ，對圓偏振光給出 φ = 2θ，覆蓋範圍天生是完整的 2π，但效率由偏振轉換率決定且會把未轉換光留在零階。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each TiO₂ nanopillar is a truncated dielectric waveguide whose diameter sets the fundamental-mode effective index n_eff, giving a transmission phase of about (2π/λ)·n_eff·h. As the diameter grows from roughly 80 nm to 200 nm at 532 nm, n_eff rises from about 1.1 to 2.1, so pillars of fixed height sweep 2π by diameter alone. The alternative is geometric phase: pillars shaped as half-wave plates and rotated by θ impart φ = 2θ to circularly polarized light, covering a full 2π by construction, but efficiency is set by the polarization-conversion ratio and unconverted light stays in the zeroth order. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：相位覆蓋 Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ；Δn_eff = 1.0、h = 600 nm、λ = 532 nm 時 Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π，足以涵蓋一整圈並留餘裕；最細柱的深寬比為 600/80 = 7.5。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Phase coverage is Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ; with Δn_eff = 1.0, h = 600 nm and λ = 532 nm, Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π, enough for a full cycle with margin; the thinnest pillar has an aspect ratio of 600/80 = 7.5.","failure":"常見誤解：「奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-05-k1","title":"超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋","titleEn":"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms","text":"每根 TiO₂ 奈米柱是一段截斷的介電波導，直徑決定基模有效折射率 n_eff，穿透相位約為 (2π/λ)·n_eff·h。直徑從約 80 nm 增到 200 nm 時，532 nm 波長下 n_eff 約從 1.1 升到 2.1，因此固定高度 h 的柱子只靠直徑就能掃過 2π。","textEn":"Each TiO₂ nanopillar is a truncated dielectric waveguide whose diameter sets the fundamental-mode effective index n_eff, giving a transmission phase of about (2π/λ)·n_eff·h. As the diameter grows from roughly 80 nm to 200 nm at 532 nm, n_eff rises from about 1.1 to 2.1, so pillars of fixed height sweep 2π by diameter alone.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms\" is correct?","options":["奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。","每根 TiO₂ 奈米柱是一段截斷的介電波導，直徑決定基模有效折射率 n_eff，穿透相位約為 (2π/λ)·n_eff·h。"],"optionsEn":["Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.","Each TiO₂ nanopillar is a truncated dielectric waveguide whose diameter sets the fundamental-mode effective index n_eff, giving a transmission phase of about (2π/λ)·n_eff·h."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每根 TiO₂ 奈米柱是一段截斷的介電波導，直徑決定基模有效折射率 n_eff，穿透相位約為 (2π/λ)·n_eff·h。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each TiO₂ nanopillar is a truncated dielectric waveguide whose diameter sets the fundamental-mode effective index n_eff, giving a transmission phase of about (2π/λ)·n_eff·h. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a417-v12-06","title":"超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋：定量估算","titleEn":"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：相位覆蓋 Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ；Δn_eff = 1.0、h = 600 nm、λ = 532 nm 時 Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π，足以涵蓋一整圈並留餘裕；最細柱的深寬比為 600/80 = 7.5。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Phase coverage is Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ; with Δn_eff = 1.0, h = 600 nm and λ = 532 nm, Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π, enough for a full cycle with margin; the thinnest pillar has an aspect ratio of 600/80 = 7.5. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 RCWA 掃描直徑 60 到 240 nm 得到相位與穿透率曲線，挑出穿透率 > 90% 且相位單調的區段做為庫；再製作同直徑的均勻柱陣列，用干涉儀量穿透相位並與模擬曲線比較，偏差應小於 0.2 rad。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Sweep diameters from 60 to 240 nm in RCWA to get phase and transmittance curves, keep the monotonic segment with transmittance above 90% as the library, then fabricate uniform arrays of each diameter and measure the transmitted phase interferometrically; deviations should stay below 0.2 rad.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"相位覆蓋 Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ；Δn_eff = 1.0、h = 600 nm、λ = 532 nm 時 Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π，足以涵蓋一整圈並留餘裕；最細柱的深寬比為 600/80 = 7.5。","textEn":"Phase coverage is Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ; with Δn_eff = 1.0, h = 600 nm and λ = 532 nm, Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π, enough for a full cycle with margin; the thinnest pillar has an aspect ratio of 600/80 = 7.5.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms\", which statement holds?","options":["相位覆蓋 Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ。","穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。","平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。"],"optionsEn":["Phase coverage is Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ.","A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%.","A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相位覆蓋 Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ；Δn_eff = 1.0、h = 600 nm、λ = 532 nm 時 Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π，足以涵蓋一整圈並留餘裕；最細柱的深寬比為 600/80 = 7.5。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Phase coverage is Δφ = 2π·Δn_eff·h/λ; with Δn_eff = 1.0, h = 600 nm and λ = 532 nm, Δφ = 7.09 rad ≈ 1.13×2π, enough for a full cycle with margin; the thinnest pillar has an aspect ratio of 600/80 = 7.5. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a417-v12-07","title":"超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋：量測與驗證","titleEn":"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 RCWA 掃描直徑 60 到 240 nm 得到相位與穿透率曲線，挑出穿透率 > 90% 且相位單調的區段做為庫；再製作同直徑的均勻柱陣列，用干涉儀量穿透相位並與模擬曲線比較，偏差應小於 0.2 rad。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Sweep diameters from 60 to 240 nm in RCWA to get phase and transmittance curves, keep the monotonic segment with transmittance above 90% as the library, then fabricate uniform arrays of each diameter and measure the transmitted phase interferometrically; deviations should stay below 0.2 rad. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若庫的直徑範圍只覆蓋 1.6π，相位剖面在每圈包裹處出現 0.4π 的缺口，光被散射到零階與高階，焦點效率降到五成以下且出現明顯的直射亮斑。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A library covering only 1.6π leaves a 0.4π gap at every phase wrap; light scatters into the zeroth and higher orders, focusing efficiency falls below half and a bright undiffracted spot appears.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 RCWA 掃描直徑 60 到 240 nm 得到相位與穿透率曲線，挑出穿透率 > 90% 且相位單調的區段做為庫；再製作同直徑的均勻柱陣列，用干涉儀量穿透相位並與模擬曲線比較，偏差應小於 0.2 rad。","textEn":"Sweep diameters from 60 to 240 nm in RCWA to get phase and transmittance curves, keep the monotonic segment with transmittance above 90% as the library, then fabricate uniform arrays of each diameter and measure the transmitted phase interferometrically; deviations should stay below 0.2 rad.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以 RCWA 掃描直徑 60 到 240 nm 得到相位與穿透率曲線，挑出穿透率 > 90% 且相位單調的區段做為庫。","平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Sweep diameters from 60 to 240 nm in RCWA to get phase and transmittance curves, keep the monotonic segment with transmittance above 90% as the library, then fabricate uniform arrays of each diameter and measure the transmitted phase interferometrically.","Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 RCWA 掃描直徑 60 到 240 nm 得到相位與穿透率曲線，挑出穿透率 > 90% 且相位單調的區段做為庫；再製作同直徑的均勻柱陣列，用干涉儀量穿透相位並與模擬曲線比較，偏差應小於 0.2 rad。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Sweep diameters from 60 to 240 nm in RCWA to get phase and transmittance curves, keep the monotonic segment with transmittance above 90% as the library, then fabricate uniform arrays of each diameter and measure the transmitted phase interferometrically; deviations should stay below 0.2 rad. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a417-v12-08","title":"超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋：失效診斷","titleEn":"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「TiO₂ 奈米柱超穎原子庫」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “TiO₂ nanopillar meta-atom library” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若庫的直徑範圍只覆蓋 1.6π，相位剖面在每圈包裹處出現 0.4π 的缺口，光被散射到零階與高階，焦點效率降到五成以下且出現明顯的直射亮斑。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A library covering only 1.6π leaves a 0.4π gap at every phase wrap; light scatters into the zeroth and higher orders, focusing efficiency falls below half and a bright undiffracted spot appears. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：另一條路是幾何相位：把柱子做成半波片並旋轉角度 θ，對圓偏振光給出 φ = 2θ，覆蓋範圍天生是完整的 2π，但效率由偏振轉換率決定且會把未轉換光留在零階。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The alternative is geometric phase: pillars shaped as half-wave plates and rotated by θ impart φ = 2θ to circularly polarized light, covering a full 2π by construction, but efficiency is set by the polarization-conversion ratio and unconverted light stays in the zeroth order.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若庫的直徑範圍只覆蓋 1.6π，相位剖面在每圈包裹處出現 0.4π 的缺口，光被散射到零階與高階，焦點效率降到五成以下且出現明顯的直射亮斑。","textEn":"A library covering only 1.6π leaves a 0.4π gap at every phase wrap; light scatters into the zeroth and higher orders, focusing efficiency falls below half and a bright undiffracted spot appears.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超穎原子的 2π 相位覆蓋」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"2π phase coverage of meta-atoms\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。","若庫的直徑範圍只覆蓋 1.6π，相位剖面在每圈包裹處出現 0.4π 的缺口，光被散射到零階與高階，焦點效率降到五成以下且出現明顯的直射亮斑。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.","A library covering only 1.6π leaves a 0.4π gap at every phase wrap."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若庫的直徑範圍只覆蓋 1.6π，相位剖面在每圈包裹處出現 0.4π 的缺口，光被散射到零階與高階，焦點效率降到五成以下且出現明顯的直射亮斑。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A library covering only 1.6π leaves a 0.4π gap at every phase wrap; light scatters into the zeroth and higher orders, focusing efficiency falls below half and a bright undiffracted spot appears. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a417-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能」與「材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput\" and \"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a417-v12-09","title":"曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"研究階段的超穎透鏡多以 100 keV 電子束直寫定義圖形，光點約 2 nm、特徵尺寸可到 10 nm，寫場約 1 mm，場間拼接與套刻誤差在 20 nm 以內；但寫入時間與曝光面積和劑量成正比、與束流成反比，公分級透鏡需要數百小時。量產改用 248 或 193 nm DUV 步進機，一次曝光一整個 26 × 33 mm 場，解析度由 k₁·λ/NA 決定，大口徑透鏡則由多個場拼接而成。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Research metalenses are usually patterned by 100 keV electron-beam direct write with a spot near 2 nm, features down to 10 nm, write fields of about 1 mm and stitching and overlay errors under 20 nm; but write time scales with exposed area times dose divided by beam current, so a centimetre-class lens would take hundreds of hours. Production moves to 248 or 193 nm DUV steppers that expose a whole 26 × 33 mm field at once with resolution set by k₁·λ/NA, and large apertures are built by stitching several fields. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：EBL 寫入時間 t = A_exp·D/I：直徑 2 mm、填充率 35% 的透鏡 A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm²，劑量 D = 1000 µC/cm²、束流 I = 1 nA 時 t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h；KrF 步進機 λ = 248 nm、NA = 0.8、k₁ = 0.35 的解析度約 110 nm，整場曝光不到 1 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: EBL write time is t = A_exp·D/I: a 2 mm lens with 35% fill has A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm², and with dose D = 1000 µC/cm² and current I = 1 nA, t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h; a KrF stepper at λ = 248 nm, NA = 0.8 and k₁ = 0.35 resolves about 110 nm and exposes a whole field in under 1 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-09-k1","title":"曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能","titleEn":"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput","text":"研究階段的超穎透鏡多以 100 keV 電子束直寫定義圖形，光點約 2 nm、特徵尺寸可到 10 nm，寫場約 1 mm，場間拼接與套刻誤差在 20 nm 以內；但寫入時間與曝光面積和劑量成正比、與束流成反比，公分級透鏡需要數百小時。量產改用 248 或 193 nm DUV 步進機，一次曝光一整個 26 × 33 mm 場，解析度由 k₁·λ/NA 決定，大口徑透鏡則由多個場拼接而成。","textEn":"Research metalenses are usually patterned by 100 keV electron-beam direct write with a spot near 2 nm, features down to 10 nm, write fields of about 1 mm and stitching and overlay errors under 20 nm; but write time scales with exposed area times dose divided by beam current, so a centimetre-class lens would take hundreds of hours. Production moves to 248 or 193 nm DUV steppers that expose a whole 26 × 33 mm field at once with resolution set by k₁·λ/NA, and large apertures are built by stitching several fields.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput\" is correct?","options":["研究階段的超穎透鏡多以 100 keV 電子束直寫定義圖形，光點約 2 nm、特徵尺寸可到 10 nm，寫場約 1 mm，場間拼接與套刻誤差在 20 nm 以內。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。","只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。"],"optionsEn":["Research metalenses are usually patterned by 100 keV electron-beam direct write with a spot near 2 nm, features down to 10 nm, write fields of about 1 mm and stitching and overlay errors under 20 nm.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.","If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"研究階段的超穎透鏡多以 100 keV 電子束直寫定義圖形，光點約 2 nm、特徵尺寸可到 10 nm，寫場約 1 mm，場間拼接與套刻誤差在 20 nm 以內；但寫入時間與曝光面積和劑量成正比、與束流成反比，公分級透鏡需要數百小時。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Research metalenses are usually patterned by 100 keV electron-beam direct write with a spot near 2 nm, features down to 10 nm, write fields of about 1 mm and stitching and overlay errors under 20 nm; but write time scales with exposed area times dose divided by beam current, so a centimetre-class lens would take hundreds of hours. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a417-v12-10","title":"曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能：定量估算","titleEn":"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：EBL 寫入時間 t = A_exp·D/I：直徑 2 mm、填充率 35% 的透鏡 A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm²，劑量 D = 1000 µC/cm²、束流 I = 1 nA 時 t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h；KrF 步進機 λ = 248 nm、NA = 0.8、k₁ = 0.35 的解析度約 110 nm，整場曝光不到 1 s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: EBL write time is t = A_exp·D/I: a 2 mm lens with 35% fill has A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm², and with dose D = 1000 µC/cm² and current I = 1 nA, t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h; a KrF stepper at λ = 248 nm, NA = 0.8 and k₁ = 0.35 resolves about 110 nm and exposes a whole field in under 1 s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用已知的劑量與束流在測試片上寫一組 1 mm² 圖案，記錄實際寫入時間並與 A·D/I 比較，差額即台架移動與穩定時間；DUV 片則在場邊界量 SEM 影像的柱位移，確認拼接誤差小於 20 nm。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Write a set of 1 mm² test patterns with known dose and current, log the actual time and compare with A·D/I so the difference reveals stage-move and settling overhead; on DUV wafers, measure pillar displacement across field boundaries in SEM images to confirm stitching below 20 nm.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"EBL 寫入時間 t = A_exp·D/I：直徑 2 mm、填充率 35% 的透鏡 A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm²，劑量 D = 1000 µC/cm²、束流 I = 1 nA 時 t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h；KrF 步進機 λ = 248 nm、NA = 0.8、k₁ = 0.35 的解析度約 110 nm，整場曝光不到 1 s。","textEn":"EBL write time is t = A_exp·D/I: a 2 mm lens with 35% fill has A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm², and with dose D = 1000 µC/cm² and current I = 1 nA, t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h; a KrF stepper at λ = 248 nm, NA = 0.8 and k₁ = 0.35 resolves about 110 nm and exposes a whole field in under 1 s.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput\", which statement holds?","options":["超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。","EBL 寫入時間 t = A_exp·D/I：直徑 2 mm、填充率 35% 的透鏡 A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm²，劑量 D = 1000 µC/cm²、束流 I = 1 nA 時 t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h。","平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。"],"optionsEn":["A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.","EBL write time is t = A_exp·D/I: a 2 mm lens with 35% fill has A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm², and with dose D = 1000 µC/cm² and current I = 1 nA, t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h.","Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging."],"answer":1,"explanation":"EBL 寫入時間 t = A_exp·D/I：直徑 2 mm、填充率 35% 的透鏡 A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm²，劑量 D = 1000 µC/cm²、束流 I = 1 nA 時 t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h；KrF 步進機 λ = 248 nm、NA = 0.8、k₁ = 0.35 的解析度約 110 nm，整場曝光不到 1 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"EBL write time is t = A_exp·D/I: a 2 mm lens with 35% fill has A_exp = 1.1×10⁻² cm², and with dose D = 1000 µC/cm² and current I = 1 nA, t = 1.1×10⁴ s ≈ 3.1 h; a KrF stepper at λ = 248 nm, NA = 0.8 and k₁ = 0.35 resolves about 110 nm and exposes a whole field in under 1 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a417-v12-11","title":"曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用已知的劑量與束流在測試片上寫一組 1 mm² 圖案，記錄實際寫入時間並與 A·D/I 比較，差額即台架移動與穩定時間；DUV 片則在場邊界量 SEM 影像的柱位移，確認拼接誤差小於 20 nm。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Write a set of 1 mm² test patterns with known dose and current, log the actual time and compare with A·D/I so the difference reveals stage-move and settling overhead; on DUV wafers, measure pillar displacement across field boundaries in SEM images to confirm stitching below 20 nm. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：EBL 的近接效應使密集區柱子過曝、孤立區欠曝，直徑在同一設計值下相差 10 nm 以上，相位庫映射失效，透鏡出現與圖形密度相關的環狀效率起伏。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: EBL proximity effects overexpose dense regions and underexpose isolated ones, so pillars of the same design diameter differ by more than 10 nm; the library mapping breaks and the lens shows ring-shaped efficiency variation tied to pattern density.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用已知的劑量與束流在測試片上寫一組 1 mm² 圖案，記錄實際寫入時間並與 A·D/I 比較，差額即台架移動與穩定時間；DUV 片則在場邊界量 SEM 影像的柱位移，確認拼接誤差小於 20 nm。","textEn":"Write a set of 1 mm² test patterns with known dose and current, log the actual time and compare with A·D/I so the difference reveals stage-move and settling overhead; on DUV wafers, measure pillar displacement across field boundaries in SEM images to confirm stitching below 20 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","用已知的劑量與束流在測試片上寫一組 1 mm² 圖案，記錄實際寫入時間並與 A·D/I 比較，差額即台架移動與穩定時間。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","Write a set of 1 mm² test patterns with known dose and current, log the actual time and compare with A·D/I so the difference reveals stage-move and settling overhead."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用已知的劑量與束流在測試片上寫一組 1 mm² 圖案，記錄實際寫入時間並與 A·D/I 比較，差額即台架移動與穩定時間；DUV 片則在場邊界量 SEM 影像的柱位移，確認拼接誤差小於 20 nm。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Write a set of 1 mm² test patterns with known dose and current, log the actual time and compare with A·D/I so the difference reveals stage-move and settling overhead; on DUV wafers, measure pillar displacement across field boundaries in SEM images to confirm stitching below 20 nm. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a417-v12-12","title":"曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能：失效診斷","titleEn":"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「電子束直寫與 DUV 步進機」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Electron-beam direct write and DUV stepper” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"EBL 的近接效應使密集區柱子過曝、孤立區欠曝，直徑在同一設計值下相差 10 nm 以上，相位庫映射失效，透鏡出現與圖形密度相關的環狀效率起伏。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"EBL proximity effects overexpose dense regions and underexpose isolated ones, so pillars of the same design diameter differ by more than 10 nm; the library mapping breaks and the lens shows ring-shaped efficiency variation tied to pattern density. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：量產改用 248 或 193 nm DUV 步進機，一次曝光一整個 26 × 33 mm 場，解析度由 k₁·λ/NA 決定，大口徑透鏡則由多個場拼接而成。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Production moves to 248 or 193 nm DUV steppers that expose a whole 26 × 33 mm field at once with resolution set by k₁·λ/NA, and large apertures are built by stitching several fields.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"EBL 的近接效應使密集區柱子過曝、孤立區欠曝，直徑在同一設計值下相差 10 nm 以上，相位庫映射失效，透鏡出現與圖形密度相關的環狀效率起伏。","textEn":"EBL proximity effects overexpose dense regions and underexpose isolated ones, so pillars of the same design diameter differ by more than 10 nm; the library mapping breaks and the lens shows ring-shaped efficiency variation tied to pattern density.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「曝光：EBL 解析度與 DUV 產能」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Exposure: EBL resolution versus DUV throughput\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["EBL 的近接效應使密集區柱子過曝、孤立區欠曝，直徑在同一設計值下相差 10 nm 以上，相位庫映射失效，透鏡出現與圖形密度相關的環狀效率起伏。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。"],"optionsEn":["EBL proximity effects overexpose dense regions and underexpose isolated ones, so pillars of the same design diameter differ by more than 10 nm.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"EBL 的近接效應使密集區柱子過曝、孤立區欠曝，直徑在同一設計值下相差 10 nm 以上，相位庫映射失效，透鏡出現與圖形密度相關的環狀效率起伏。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"EBL proximity effects overexpose dense regions and underexpose isolated ones, so pillars of the same design diameter differ by more than 10 nm; the library mapping breaks and the lens shows ring-shaped efficiency variation tied to pattern density. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a417-v12-13","title":"材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"可見光超穎透鏡需要高折射率、低吸收的材料：TiO₂（n ≈ 2.4、k \u003c 10⁻⁴）與 GaN 適用可見光，非晶矽在 532 nm 吸收過大但在 940 nm 近紅外幾乎無損。TiO₂ 常以原子層沉積填入電子束阻劑的孔洞，再回蝕頂層並去除阻劑，形成垂直側壁的柱子；非晶矽或 GaN 則以硬遮罩加電感耦合電漿乾蝕刻成形。側壁角度、底部殘留與柱頂圓角都會改變 n_eff，等效於直徑誤差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Visible metalenses need high-index, low-loss materials: TiO₂ (n ≈ 2.4, k \u003c 10⁻⁴) and GaN serve the visible, whereas amorphous silicon absorbs too strongly at 532 nm but is nearly lossless at 940 nm in the near infrared. TiO₂ is usually grown by atomic-layer deposition into holes of an electron-beam resist, then etched back and freed from resist to leave vertical pillars; amorphous silicon or GaN is shaped by inductively coupled plasma etching through a hard mask. Sidewall angle, footing and top rounding all change n_eff and act like diameter errors. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：側壁偏離垂直 α 時，上下直徑差 Δd = 2·h·tanα；h = 600 nm、α = 2° 時 Δd = 41.9 nm，相當於跨越相位庫中約四個 10 nm 直徑階。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A sidewall tilted by α from vertical gives a top-to-bottom diameter difference Δd = 2·h·tanα; for h = 600 nm and α = 2°, Δd = 41.9 nm, which spans about four 10 nm diameter steps of the library.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-13-k1","title":"材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制","titleEn":"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control","text":"可見光超穎透鏡需要高折射率、低吸收的材料：TiO₂（n ≈ 2.4、k \u003c 10⁻⁴）與 GaN 適用可見光，非晶矽在 532 nm 吸收過大但在 940 nm 近紅外幾乎無損。TiO₂ 常以原子層沉積填入電子束阻劑的孔洞，再回蝕頂層並去除阻劑，形成垂直側壁的柱子；非晶矽或 GaN 則以硬遮罩加電感耦合電漿乾蝕刻成形。","textEn":"Visible metalenses need high-index, low-loss materials: TiO₂ (n ≈ 2.4, k \u003c 10⁻⁴) and GaN serve the visible, whereas amorphous silicon absorbs too strongly at 532 nm but is nearly lossless at 940 nm in the near infrared. TiO₂ is usually grown by atomic-layer deposition into holes of an electron-beam resist, then etched back and freed from resist to leave vertical pillars; amorphous silicon or GaN is shaped by inductively coupled plasma etching through a hard mask.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control\" is correct?","options":["只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。","可見光超穎透鏡需要高折射率、低吸收的材料：TiO₂（n ≈ 2.4、k \u003c 10⁻⁴）與 GaN 適用可見光，非晶矽在 532 nm 吸收過大但在 940 nm 近紅外幾乎無損。","穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。"],"optionsEn":["If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.","Visible metalenses need high-index, low-loss materials: TiO₂ (n ≈ 2.4, k \u003c 10⁻⁴) and GaN serve the visible, whereas amorphous silicon absorbs too strongly at 532 nm but is nearly lossless at 940 nm in the near infrared.","A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%."],"answer":1,"explanation":"可見光超穎透鏡需要高折射率、低吸收的材料：TiO₂（n ≈ 2.4、k \u003c 10⁻⁴）與 GaN 適用可見光，非晶矽在 532 nm 吸收過大但在 940 nm 近紅外幾乎無損。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Visible metalenses need high-index, low-loss materials: TiO₂ (n ≈ 2.4, k \u003c 10⁻⁴) and GaN serve the visible, whereas amorphous silicon absorbs too strongly at 532 nm but is nearly lossless at 940 nm in the near infrared. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a417-v12-14","title":"材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：側壁偏離垂直 α 時，上下直徑差 Δd = 2·h·tanα；h = 600 nm、α = 2° 時 Δd = 41.9 nm，相當於跨越相位庫中約四個 10 nm 直徑階。ALD 填滿最大 200 nm 孔需 ≥ 100 nm 膜厚，以 0.06 nm/cycle 計約 1,700 個循環。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A sidewall tilted by α from vertical gives a top-to-bottom diameter difference Δd = 2·h·tanα; for h = 600 nm and α = 2°, Δd = 41.9 nm, which spans about four 10 nm diameter steps of the library. Filling the largest 200 nm hole by ALD needs at least 100 nm of film, roughly 1,700 cycles at 0.06 nm per cycle. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：切片或傾斜 SEM 量側壁角與柱高，橢偏儀量 ALD 膜的折射率與消光係數，並用一片均勻柱陣列量穿透率；三者代入 RCWA 重新計算相位庫，與原設計曲線比較後決定是否需要重新映射直徑。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure sidewall angle and pillar height by cross-section or tilted SEM, measure the ALD film index and extinction by ellipsometry, and measure transmittance on a uniform pillar array; feed all three into RCWA to recompute the library and compare with the design curve before deciding whether diameters must be remapped.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"側壁偏離垂直 α 時，上下直徑差 Δd = 2·h·tanα；h = 600 nm、α = 2° 時 Δd = 41.9 nm，相當於跨越相位庫中約四個 10 nm 直徑階。ALD 填滿最大 200 nm 孔需 ≥ 100 nm 膜厚，以 0.06 nm/cycle 計約 1,700 個循環。","textEn":"A sidewall tilted by α from vertical gives a top-to-bottom diameter difference Δd = 2·h·tanα; for h = 600 nm and α = 2°, Δd = 41.9 nm, which spans about four 10 nm diameter steps of the library. Filling the largest 200 nm hole by ALD needs at least 100 nm of film, roughly 1,700 cycles at 0.06 nm per cycle.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control\", which statement holds?","options":["平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。","只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","側壁偏離垂直 α 時，上下直徑差 Δd = 2·h·tanα。"],"optionsEn":["A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre.","As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","A sidewall tilted by α from vertical gives a top-to-bottom diameter difference Δd = 2·h·tanα."],"answer":2,"explanation":"側壁偏離垂直 α 時，上下直徑差 Δd = 2·h·tanα；h = 600 nm、α = 2° 時 Δd = 41.9 nm，相當於跨越相位庫中約四個 10 nm 直徑階。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A sidewall tilted by α from vertical gives a top-to-bottom diameter difference Δd = 2·h·tanα; for h = 600 nm and α = 2°, Δd = 41.9 nm, which spans about four 10 nm diameter steps of the library. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a417-v12-15","title":"材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"切片或傾斜 SEM 量側壁角與柱高，橢偏儀量 ALD 膜的折射率與消光係數，並用一片均勻柱陣列量穿透率；三者代入 RCWA 重新計算相位庫，與原設計曲線比較後決定是否需要重新映射直徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure sidewall angle and pillar height by cross-section or tilted SEM, measure the ALD film index and extinction by ellipsometry, and measure transmittance on a uniform pillar array; feed all three into RCWA to recompute the library and compare with the design curve before deciding whether diameters must be remapped. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：乾蝕刻選擇比不足時硬遮罩在最細柱上先耗盡，柱頂被削成錐形，細柱區（對應相位剖面的特定圈帶）穿透相位系統性偏移，焦點出現可量測的球差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When etch selectivity is insufficient the hard mask is consumed first on the thinnest pillars, tapering their tops; those pillar bands, which map to specific phase zones, shift phase systematically and the focus shows measurable spherical aberration.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"切片或傾斜 SEM 量側壁角與柱高，橢偏儀量 ALD 膜的折射率與消光係數，並用一片均勻柱陣列量穿透率；三者代入 RCWA 重新計算相位庫，與原設計曲線比較後決定是否需要重新映射直徑。","textEn":"Measure sidewall angle and pillar height by cross-section or tilted SEM, measure the ALD film index and extinction by ellipsometry, and measure transmittance on a uniform pillar array; feed all three into RCWA to recompute the library and compare with the design curve before deciding whether diameters must be remapped.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control\"?","options":["切片或傾斜 SEM 量側壁角與柱高，橢偏儀量 ALD 膜的折射率與消光係數，並用一片均勻柱陣列量穿透率。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。"],"optionsEn":["Measure sidewall angle and pillar height by cross-section or tilted SEM, measure the ALD film index and extinction by ellipsometry, and measure transmittance on a uniform pillar array.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"切片或傾斜 SEM 量側壁角與柱高，橢偏儀量 ALD 膜的折射率與消光係數，並用一片均勻柱陣列量穿透率；三者代入 RCWA 重新計算相位庫，與原設計曲線比較後決定是否需要重新映射直徑。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure sidewall angle and pillar height by cross-section or tilted SEM, measure the ALD film index and extinction by ellipsometry, and measure transmittance on a uniform pillar array; feed all three into RCWA to recompute the library and compare with the design curve before deciding whether diameters must be remapped. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a417-v12-16","title":"材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「ALD 填充與高深寬比乾蝕刻」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “ALD fill and high-aspect-ratio dry etch” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"乾蝕刻選擇比不足時硬遮罩在最細柱上先耗盡，柱頂被削成錐形，細柱區（對應相位剖面的特定圈帶）穿透相位系統性偏移，焦點出現可量測的球差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When etch selectivity is insufficient the hard mask is consumed first on the thinnest pillars, tapering their tops; those pillar bands, which map to specific phase zones, shift phase systematically and the focus shows measurable spherical aberration. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：側壁角度、底部殘留與柱頂圓角都會改變 n_eff，等效於直徑誤差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Sidewall angle, footing and top rounding all change n_eff and act like diameter errors.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"乾蝕刻選擇比不足時硬遮罩在最細柱上先耗盡，柱頂被削成錐形，細柱區（對應相位剖面的特定圈帶）穿透相位系統性偏移，焦點出現可量測的球差。","textEn":"When etch selectivity is insufficient the hard mask is consumed first on the thinnest pillars, tapering their tops; those pillar bands, which map to specific phase zones, shift phase systematically and the focus shows measurable spherical aberration.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料、ALD 與蝕刻側壁控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Materials, ALD and etch-sidewall control\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","乾蝕刻選擇比不足時硬遮罩在最細柱上先耗盡，柱頂被削成錐形，細柱區（對應相位剖面的特定圈帶）穿透相位系統性偏移，焦點出現可量測的球差。","穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","When etch selectivity is insufficient the hard mask is consumed first on the thinnest pillars, tapering their tops.","A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%."],"answer":1,"explanation":"乾蝕刻選擇比不足時硬遮罩在最細柱上先耗盡，柱頂被削成錐形，細柱區（對應相位剖面的特定圈帶）穿透相位系統性偏移，焦點出現可量測的球差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When etch selectivity is insufficient the hard mask is consumed first on the thinnest pillars, tapering their tops; those pillar bands, which map to specific phase zones, shift phase systematically and the focus shows measurable spherical aberration. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a417-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」與「色差、景深與消色差極限」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\" and \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a417-v12-17","title":"聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"聚焦效率定義為焦點附近（常取 3 倍 FWHM 半徑的圓）內的功率除以入射功率，必須與穿透率分開報告，因為未聚焦的零階光也會穿透。焦斑用一支 NA 高於待測透鏡的顯微物鏡放大成像到相機，以像素尺寸與放大率換算 FWHM；Strehl 比由實測峰值強度對理想 Airy 峰值的比值求得，或由 PSF 反推波前 RMS。入射光需以已知偏振與準直度照明，否則量到的是光源而非透鏡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Focusing efficiency is the power inside a circle of about three FWHM radii around the focus divided by the incident power, and must be reported separately from transmittance because undiffracted zeroth-order light is also transmitted. The spot is relayed to a camera by a microscope objective whose NA exceeds that of the lens under test, and FWHM is converted through pixel size and magnification; the Strehl ratio comes from the measured peak against the ideal Airy peak or from the wavefront RMS inferred from the PSF. Illumination must have known polarization and collimation, otherwise the source rather than the lens is being measured. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：繞射極限 FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm，故針孔或積分圓取直徑約 1 µm；基板背面未鍍膜的 Fresnel 損失 R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5%，須在效率計算中扣除或鍍增透膜消除。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The diffraction-limited FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm, so the pinhole or integration circle is about 1 µm in diameter; the uncoated substrate back face loses R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5% by Fresnel reflection, which must be removed from the efficiency bookkeeping or eliminated with an AR coating.","failure":"常見誤解：「穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-17-k1","title":"聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測","titleEn":"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement","text":"聚焦效率定義為焦點附近（常取 3 倍 FWHM 半徑的圓）內的功率除以入射功率，必須與穿透率分開報告，因為未聚焦的零階光也會穿透。焦斑用一支 NA 高於待測透鏡的顯微物鏡放大成像到相機，以像素尺寸與放大率換算 FWHM；Strehl 比由實測峰值強度對理想 Airy 峰值的比值求得，或由 PSF 反推波前 RMS。","textEn":"Focusing efficiency is the power inside a circle of about three FWHM radii around the focus divided by the incident power, and must be reported separately from transmittance because undiffracted zeroth-order light is also transmitted. The spot is relayed to a camera by a microscope objective whose NA exceeds that of the lens under test, and FWHM is converted through pixel size and magnification; the Strehl ratio comes from the measured peak against the ideal Airy peak or from the wavefront RMS inferred from the PSF.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\" is correct?","options":["穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。","超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。","聚焦效率定義為焦點附近（常取 3 倍 FWHM 半徑的圓）內的功率除以入射功率，必須與穿透率分開報告，因為未聚焦的零階光也會穿透。"],"optionsEn":["A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%.","A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.","Focusing efficiency is the power inside a circle of about three FWHM radii around the focus divided by the incident power, and must be reported separately from transmittance because undiffracted zeroth-order light is also transmitted."],"answer":2,"explanation":"聚焦效率定義為焦點附近（常取 3 倍 FWHM 半徑的圓）內的功率除以入射功率，必須與穿透率分開報告，因為未聚焦的零階光也會穿透。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Focusing efficiency is the power inside a circle of about three FWHM radii around the focus divided by the incident power, and must be reported separately from transmittance because undiffracted zeroth-order light is also transmitted. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a417-v12-18","title":"聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：繞射極限 FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm，故針孔或積分圓取直徑約 1 µm；基板背面未鍍膜的 Fresnel 損失 R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5%，須在效率計算中扣除或鍍增透膜消除。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The diffraction-limited FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm, so the pinhole or integration circle is about 1 µm in diameter; the uncoated substrate back face loses R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5% by Fresnel reflection, which must be removed from the efficiency bookkeeping or eliminated with an AR coating. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：先用不含超穎結構的同批基板量穿透率做基準，再量透鏡的總穿透與焦點內功率；掃描 z 軸記錄焦斑強度曲線確認真正焦面，並以 NA 0.9 物鏡量 FWHM，與 339 nm 比較；兩種方法的效率差應小於 2%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure transmittance on a bare substrate from the same batch as a baseline, then the total transmission and in-focus power of the lens; scan z to locate the true focal plane from the peak-intensity curve, measure FWHM with an NA 0.9 objective and compare with 339 nm; the two efficiency methods should agree within 2%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"繞射極限 FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm，故針孔或積分圓取直徑約 1 µm；基板背面未鍍膜的 Fresnel 損失 R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5%，須在效率計算中扣除或鍍增透膜消除。","textEn":"The diffraction-limited FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm, so the pinhole or integration circle is about 1 µm in diameter; the uncoated substrate back face loses R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5% by Fresnel reflection, which must be removed from the efficiency bookkeeping or eliminated with an AR coating.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\", which statement holds?","options":["繞射極限 FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm，故針孔或積分圓取直徑約 1 µm。","平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。","奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。"],"optionsEn":["The diffraction-limited FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm, so the pinhole or integration circle is about 1 µm in diameter.","Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging.","Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"繞射極限 FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm，故針孔或積分圓取直徑約 1 µm；基板背面未鍍膜的 Fresnel 損失 R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5%，須在效率計算中扣除或鍍增透膜消除。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The diffraction-limited FWHM ≈ 0.51·λ/NA = 0.51×532/0.8 ≈ 339 nm, so the pinhole or integration circle is about 1 µm in diameter; the uncoated substrate back face loses R = ((1.46 − 1)/(1.46 + 1))² ≈ 3.5% by Fresnel reflection, which must be removed from the efficiency bookkeeping or eliminated with an AR coating. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a417-v12-19","title":"聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"先用不含超穎結構的同批基板量穿透率做基準，再量透鏡的總穿透與焦點內功率；掃描 z 軸記錄焦斑強度曲線確認真正焦面，並以 NA 0.9 物鏡量 FWHM，與 339 nm 比較；兩種方法的效率差應小於 2%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure transmittance on a bare substrate from the same batch as a baseline, then the total transmission and in-focus power of the lens; scan z to locate the true focal plane from the peak-intensity curve, measure FWHM with an NA 0.9 objective and compare with 339 nm; the two efficiency methods should agree within 2%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用 NA 0.5 的物鏡觀察 NA 0.8 的焦斑會把 PSF 擴寬一倍以上，FWHM 與 Strehl 都被低估；若同時把零階穿透光算進焦點功率，效率又被高估，兩個錯誤互相掩蓋。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Viewing an NA 0.8 focus with an NA 0.5 objective more than doubles the apparent PSF, underestimating FWHM and Strehl; counting zeroth-order transmission as focal power then overstates efficiency, and the two errors mask each other.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先用不含超穎結構的同批基板量穿透率做基準，再量透鏡的總穿透與焦點內功率；掃描 z 軸記錄焦斑強度曲線確認真正焦面，並以 NA 0.9 物鏡量 FWHM，與 339 nm 比較；兩種方法的效率差應小於 2%。","textEn":"Measure transmittance on a bare substrate from the same batch as a baseline, then the total transmission and in-focus power of the lens; scan z to locate the true focal plane from the peak-intensity curve, measure FWHM with an NA 0.9 objective and compare with 339 nm; the two efficiency methods should agree within 2%.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","先用不含超穎結構的同批基板量穿透率做基準，再量透鏡的總穿透與焦點內功率。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure transmittance on a bare substrate from the same batch as a baseline, then the total transmission and in-focus power of the lens.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先用不含超穎結構的同批基板量穿透率做基準，再量透鏡的總穿透與焦點內功率；掃描 z 軸記錄焦斑強度曲線確認真正焦面，並以 NA 0.9 物鏡量 FWHM，與 339 nm 比較；兩種方法的效率差應小於 2%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure transmittance on a bare substrate from the same batch as a baseline, then the total transmission and in-focus power of the lens; scan z to locate the true focal plane from the peak-intensity curve, measure FWHM with an NA 0.9 objective and compare with 339 nm; the two efficiency methods should agree within 2%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a417-v12-20","title":"聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「焦平面顯微成像與針孔功率計」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Focal-plane microscope and pinhole power meter” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用 NA 0.5 的物鏡觀察 NA 0.8 的焦斑會把 PSF 擴寬一倍以上，FWHM 與 Strehl 都被低估；若同時把零階穿透光算進焦點功率，效率又被高估，兩個錯誤互相掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Viewing an NA 0.8 focus with an NA 0.5 objective more than doubles the apparent PSF, underestimating FWHM and Strehl; counting zeroth-order transmission as focal power then overstates efficiency, and the two errors mask each other. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：入射光需以已知偏振與準直度照明，否則量到的是光源而非透鏡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Illumination must have known polarization and collimation, otherwise the source rather than the lens is being measured.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用 NA 0.5 的物鏡觀察 NA 0.8 的焦斑會把 PSF 擴寬一倍以上，FWHM 與 Strehl 都被低估；若同時把零階穿透光算進焦點功率，效率又被高估，兩個錯誤互相掩蓋。","textEn":"Viewing an NA 0.8 focus with an NA 0.5 objective more than doubles the apparent PSF, underestimating FWHM and Strehl; counting zeroth-order transmission as focal power then overstates efficiency, and the two errors mask each other.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。","用 NA 0.5 的物鏡觀察 NA 0.8 的焦斑會把 PSF 擴寬一倍以上，FWHM 與 Strehl 都被低估。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.","Viewing an NA 0.8 focus with an NA 0.5 objective more than doubles the apparent PSF, underestimating FWHM and Strehl."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用 NA 0.5 的物鏡觀察 NA 0.8 的焦斑會把 PSF 擴寬一倍以上，FWHM 與 Strehl 都被低估；若同時把零階穿透光算進焦點功率，效率又被高估，兩個錯誤互相掩蓋。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Viewing an NA 0.8 focus with an NA 0.5 objective more than doubles the apparent PSF, underestimating FWHM and Strehl; counting zeroth-order transmission as focal power then overstates efficiency, and the two errors mask each other. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a417-v12-21","title":"色差、景深與消色差極限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tunable source and axial focal shift” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"單層超穎透鏡本質上是繞射元件，焦距與波長近似成反比，f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ，與折射透鏡的色差方向相反且大得多。高 NA 時景深 λ/NA² 只有一個微米以下，所以可用頻寬極窄。要消色差必須讓每個超穎原子同時提供正確的相位與群延遲，而群延遲範圍受奈米柱高度限制在數十飛秒，因此消色差設計只在口徑數十微米的透鏡上成立，大口徑則改用多層或繞射折射混合。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A single-layer metalens is intrinsically diffractive: focal length scales roughly inversely with wavelength, f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ, opposite in sign and far larger than refractive chromatic aberration. At high NA the depth of focus λ/NA² is below one micrometre, so the usable bandwidth is very narrow. Achromatization requires each meta-atom to supply the correct phase and group delay together, and the group-delay range available from sub-micrometre pillars is a few tens of femtoseconds, so achromatic designs hold only for apertures of tens of micrometres while larger lenses use multilayer or hybrid refractive-diffractive schemes. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Tunable source and axial focal shift”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ：f = 0.75 mm、Δλ = 8 nm 時 Δf ≈ −11.3 µm，而景深 λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移了約 14 個景深；允許 1 個景深的頻寬僅 Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ: for f = 0.75 mm and Δλ = 8 nm, Δf ≈ −11.3 µm, while the depth of focus λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm, so the focus moves about 14 depths of focus; the bandwidth for one depth of focus is only Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Tunable source and axial focal shift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-21-k1","title":"色差、景深與消色差極限","titleEn":"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits","text":"單層超穎透鏡本質上是繞射元件，焦距與波長近似成反比，f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ，與折射透鏡的色差方向相反且大得多。高 NA 時景深 λ/NA² 只有一個微米以下，所以可用頻寬極窄。","textEn":"A single-layer metalens is intrinsically diffractive: focal length scales roughly inversely with wavelength, f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ, opposite in sign and far larger than refractive chromatic aberration. At high NA the depth of focus λ/NA² is below one micrometre, so the usable bandwidth is very narrow.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「色差、景深與消色差極限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\" is correct?","options":["單層超穎透鏡本質上是繞射元件，焦距與波長近似成反比，f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ，與折射透鏡的色差方向相反且大得多。","超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。","平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。"],"optionsEn":["A single-layer metalens is intrinsically diffractive: focal length scales roughly inversely with wavelength, f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ, opposite in sign and far larger than refractive chromatic aberration.","A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.","A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre."],"answer":0,"explanation":"單層超穎透鏡本質上是繞射元件，焦距與波長近似成反比，f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ，與折射透鏡的色差方向相反且大得多。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A single-layer metalens is intrinsically diffractive: focal length scales roughly inversely with wavelength, f(λ) ≈ f₀·λ₀/λ, opposite in sign and far larger than refractive chromatic aberration. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a417-v12-22","title":"色差、景深與消色差極限：定量估算","titleEn":"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tunable source and axial focal shift” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ：f = 0.75 mm、Δλ = 8 nm 時 Δf ≈ −11.3 µm，而景深 λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移了約 14 個景深；允許 1 個景深的頻寬僅 Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm。消色差所需群延遲範圍 (√(R² + f²) − f)/c 在 R = 25 µm、f = 50 µm 時為 19.7 fs，在 R = 1 mm、f = 0.75 mm 時達 1.67 ps。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ: for f = 0.75 mm and Δλ = 8 nm, Δf ≈ −11.3 µm, while the depth of focus λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm, so the focus moves about 14 depths of focus; the bandwidth for one depth of focus is only Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm. The group-delay range needed for achromatization, (√(R² + f²) − f)/c, is 19.7 fs for R = 25 µm and f = 50 µm but 1.67 ps for R = 1 mm and f = 0.75 mm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以可調雷射或單色儀每 5 nm 掃一個波長，對每個波長做 z 掃描找焦面並記錄效率，將 f(λ) 與 f₀λ₀/λ 比較；斜率偏離表示超穎原子的相位色散不同於理想繞射，應回饋到庫的群延遲模型。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Scan a tunable laser or monochromator in 5 nm steps, z-scan at each wavelength to locate the focus and log efficiency, and compare f(λ) with f₀λ₀/λ; a slope deviation means the meta-atom phase dispersion differs from the ideal diffractive case and should feed back into the library's group-delay model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ：f = 0.75 mm、Δλ = 8 nm 時 Δf ≈ −11.3 µm，而景深 λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移了約 14 個景深；允許 1 個景深的頻寬僅 Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm。消色差所需群延遲範圍 (√(R² + f²) − f)/c 在 R = 25 µm、f = 50 µm 時為 19.7 fs，在 R = 1 mm、f = 0.75 mm 時達 1.67 ps。","textEn":"Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ: for f = 0.75 mm and Δλ = 8 nm, Δf ≈ −11.3 µm, while the depth of focus λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm, so the focus moves about 14 depths of focus; the bandwidth for one depth of focus is only Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm. The group-delay range needed for achromatization, (√(R² + f²) − f)/c, is 19.7 fs for R = 25 µm and f = 50 µm but 1.67 ps for R = 1 mm and f = 0.75 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「色差、景深與消色差極限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\", which statement holds?","options":["只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ：f = 0.75 mm、Δλ = 8 nm 時 Δf ≈ −11.3 µm，而景深 λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移了約 14 個景深。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ: for f = 0.75 mm and Δλ = 8 nm, Δf ≈ −11.3 µm, while the depth of focus λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm, so the focus moves about 14 depths of focus.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ：f = 0.75 mm、Δλ = 8 nm 時 Δf ≈ −11.3 µm，而景深 λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm，焦點移了約 14 個景深；允許 1 個景深的頻寬僅 Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Δf ≈ −f·Δλ/λ: for f = 0.75 mm and Δλ = 8 nm, Δf ≈ −11.3 µm, while the depth of focus λ/NA² = 532 nm/0.64 ≈ 0.83 µm, so the focus moves about 14 depths of focus; the bandwidth for one depth of focus is only Δλ = λ·DOF/f ≈ 0.59 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a417-v12-23","title":"色差、景深與消色差極限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Tunable source and axial focal shift” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以可調雷射或單色儀每 5 nm 掃一個波長，對每個波長做 z 掃描找焦面並記錄效率，將 f(λ) 與 f₀λ₀/λ 比較；斜率偏離表示超穎原子的相位色散不同於理想繞射，應回饋到庫的群延遲模型。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Scan a tunable laser or monochromator in 5 nm steps, z-scan at each wavelength to locate the focus and log efficiency, and compare f(λ) with f₀λ₀/λ; a slope deviation means the meta-atom phase dispersion differs from the ideal diffractive case and should feed back into the library's group-delay model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把為 532 nm 雷射設計的透鏡接到 30 nm 頻寬的綠光 LED，焦點沿軸拉成數十微米長的色散光柱，影像對比崩潰，常被誤判為製程缺陷。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Pairing a lens designed for a 532 nm laser with a 30 nm wide green LED stretches the focus into a tens-of-micrometre axial chromatic column; image contrast collapses and the result is often misread as a fabrication defect.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以可調雷射或單色儀每 5 nm 掃一個波長，對每個波長做 z 掃描找焦面並記錄效率，將 f(λ) 與 f₀λ₀/λ 比較；斜率偏離表示超穎原子的相位色散不同於理想繞射，應回饋到庫的群延遲模型。","textEn":"Scan a tunable laser or monochromator in 5 nm steps, z-scan at each wavelength to locate the focus and log efficiency, and compare f(λ) with f₀λ₀/λ; a slope deviation means the meta-atom phase dispersion differs from the ideal diffractive case and should feed back into the library's group-delay model.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「色差、景深與消色差極限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。","以可調雷射或單色儀每 5 nm 掃一個波長，對每個波長做 z 掃描找焦面並記錄效率，將 f(λ) 與 f₀λ₀/λ 比較。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.","Scan a tunable laser or monochromator in 5 nm steps, z-scan at each wavelength to locate the focus and log efficiency, and compare f(λ) with f₀λ₀/λ."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以可調雷射或單色儀每 5 nm 掃一個波長，對每個波長做 z 掃描找焦面並記錄效率，將 f(λ) 與 f₀λ₀/λ 比較；斜率偏離表示超穎原子的相位色散不同於理想繞射，應回饋到庫的群延遲模型。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Scan a tunable laser or monochromator in 5 nm steps, z-scan at each wavelength to locate the focus and log efficiency, and compare f(λ) with f₀λ₀/λ; a slope deviation means the meta-atom phase dispersion differs from the ideal diffractive case and should feed back into the library's group-delay model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a417-v12-24","title":"色差、景深與消色差極限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波長掃描光源與 z 軸焦點位移」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Tunable source and axial focal shift” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把為 532 nm 雷射設計的透鏡接到 30 nm 頻寬的綠光 LED，焦點沿軸拉成數十微米長的色散光柱，影像對比崩潰，常被誤判為製程缺陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Pairing a lens designed for a 532 nm laser with a 30 nm wide green LED stretches the focus into a tens-of-micrometre axial chromatic column; image contrast collapses and the result is often misread as a fabrication defect. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：要消色差必須讓每個超穎原子同時提供正確的相位與群延遲，而群延遲範圍受奈米柱高度限制在數十飛秒，因此消色差設計只在口徑數十微米的透鏡上成立，大口徑則改用多層或繞射折射混合。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Achromatization requires each meta-atom to supply the correct phase and group delay together, and the group-delay range available from sub-micrometre pillars is a few tens of femtoseconds, so achromatic designs hold only for apertures of tens of micrometres while larger lenses use multilayer or hybrid refractive-diffractive schemes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把為 532 nm 雷射設計的透鏡接到 30 nm 頻寬的綠光 LED，焦點沿軸拉成數十微米長的色散光柱，影像對比崩潰，常被誤判為製程缺陷。","textEn":"Pairing a lens designed for a 532 nm laser with a 30 nm wide green LED stretches the focus into a tens-of-micrometre axial chromatic column; image contrast collapses and the result is often misread as a fabrication defect.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「色差、景深與消色差極限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把為 532 nm 雷射設計的透鏡接到 30 nm 頻寬的綠光 LED，焦點沿軸拉成數十微米長的色散光柱，影像對比崩潰，常被誤判為製程缺陷。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。"],"optionsEn":["Pairing a lens designed for a 532 nm laser with a 30 nm wide green LED stretches the focus into a tens-of-micrometre axial chromatic column.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把為 532 nm 雷射設計的透鏡接到 30 nm 頻寬的綠光 LED，焦點沿軸拉成數十微米長的色散光柱，影像對比崩潰，常被誤判為製程缺陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Pairing a lens designed for a 532 nm laser with a 30 nm wide green LED stretches the focus into a tens-of-micrometre axial chromatic column; image contrast collapses and the result is often misread as a fabrication defect. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a417-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位」與「關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment\" and \"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a417-v12-25","title":"晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"量產超穎透鏡在 200 或 300 mm 晶圓上一次做出數千顆，整合工作包括背面增透鍍膜、保護層、切割與和影像感測器或 VCSEL 的對位。DUV 步進機的場拼接線會穿過大口徑透鏡，拼接位移等於在該線兩側加一個相位台階，其大小由局部相位梯度決定；模組對位則由透鏡傾斜造成的慧差與去中心造成的影像偏移決定公差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Production metalenses are made by the thousand on 200 or 300 mm wafers, and integration covers backside antireflection coating, protective layers, dicing and alignment to an image sensor or VCSEL. Stepper field boundaries cross a large-aperture lens, and a stitching displacement equals a phase step across that line whose size is set by the local phase gradient; module alignment tolerances come from the coma induced by lens tilt and the image shift induced by decentre. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：邊緣相位梯度 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm；20 nm 的拼接位移造成 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 的波前台階，低於 Maréchal 的 λ/14 RMS 許可；若位移達 100 nm，台階為 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6，單獨就吃掉大半預算。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The rim phase gradient is 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm; a 20 nm stitching displacement produces a 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 wavefront step, below the Maréchal λ/14 RMS allowance, whereas a 100 nm displacement gives 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6 and alone consumes most of the budget.","failure":"常見誤解：「平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-25-k1","title":"晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位","titleEn":"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment","text":"量產超穎透鏡在 200 或 300 mm 晶圓上一次做出數千顆，整合工作包括背面增透鍍膜、保護層、切割與和影像感測器或 VCSEL 的對位。DUV 步進機的場拼接線會穿過大口徑透鏡，拼接位移等於在該線兩側加一個相位台階，其大小由局部相位梯度決定；模組對位則由透鏡傾斜造成的慧差與去中心造成的影像偏移決定公差。","textEn":"Production metalenses are made by the thousand on 200 or 300 mm wafers, and integration covers backside antireflection coating, protective layers, dicing and alignment to an image sensor or VCSEL. Stepper field boundaries cross a large-aperture lens, and a stitching displacement equals a phase step across that line whose size is set by the local phase gradient; module alignment tolerances come from the coma induced by lens tilt and the image shift induced by decentre.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment\" is correct?","options":["平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。","量產超穎透鏡在 200 或 300 mm 晶圓上一次做出數千顆，整合工作包括背面增透鍍膜、保護層、切割與和影像感測器或 VCSEL 的對位。","平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。"],"optionsEn":["A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre.","Production metalenses are made by the thousand on 200 or 300 mm wafers, and integration covers backside antireflection coating, protective layers, dicing and alignment to an image sensor or VCSEL.","Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging."],"answer":1,"explanation":"量產超穎透鏡在 200 或 300 mm 晶圓上一次做出數千顆，整合工作包括背面增透鍍膜、保護層、切割與和影像感測器或 VCSEL 的對位。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Production metalenses are made by the thousand on 200 or 300 mm wafers, and integration covers backside antireflection coating, protective layers, dicing and alignment to an image sensor or VCSEL. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a417-v12-26","title":"晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位：定量估算","titleEn":"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：邊緣相位梯度 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm；20 nm 的拼接位移造成 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 的波前台階，低於 Maréchal 的 λ/14 RMS 許可；若位移達 100 nm，台階為 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6，單獨就吃掉大半預算。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The rim phase gradient is 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm; a 20 nm stitching displacement produces a 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 wavefront step, below the Maréchal λ/14 RMS allowance, whereas a 100 nm displacement gives 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6 and alone consumes most of the budget. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以晶圓級干涉儀或 Shack–Hartmann 量穿透波前，在拼接線位置尋找台階並換算為位移，與 SEM 直接量得的柱位移比對；模組端用 MTF 靶量各視場的 MTF，確認傾斜與去中心在公差內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the transmitted wavefront with a wafer-level interferometer or Shack–Hartmann sensor, look for a step at the stitch line, convert it to displacement and compare with pillar displacement measured directly by SEM; at module level, measure MTF across the field with a target to confirm tilt and decentre are within tolerance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"邊緣相位梯度 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm；20 nm 的拼接位移造成 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 的波前台階，低於 Maréchal 的 λ/14 RMS 許可；若位移達 100 nm，台階為 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6，單獨就吃掉大半預算。","textEn":"The rim phase gradient is 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm; a 20 nm stitching displacement produces a 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 wavefront step, below the Maréchal λ/14 RMS allowance, whereas a 100 nm displacement gives 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6 and alone consumes most of the budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment\", which statement holds?","options":["奈米柱越高相位控制越好，所以高度沒有上限。","只要材料折射率夠高，吸收大一點在可見光也無妨。","邊緣相位梯度 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm。"],"optionsEn":["Taller pillars always give better phase control, so height has no upper limit.","If the index is high enough, some absorption in the visible is harmless.","The rim phase gradient is 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"邊緣相位梯度 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm；20 nm 的拼接位移造成 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 的波前台階，低於 Maréchal 的 λ/14 RMS 許可；若位移達 100 nm，台階為 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6，單獨就吃掉大半預算。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The rim phase gradient is 2π·NA/λ = 2π×0.8/0.532 µm ≈ 9.45 rad/µm; a 20 nm stitching displacement produces a 0.19 rad ≈ λ/33 wavefront step, below the Maréchal λ/14 RMS allowance, whereas a 100 nm displacement gives 0.95 rad ≈ λ/6.6 and alone consumes most of the budget. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a417-v12-27","title":"晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以晶圓級干涉儀或 Shack–Hartmann 量穿透波前，在拼接線位置尋找台階並換算為位移，與 SEM 直接量得的柱位移比對；模組端用 MTF 靶量各視場的 MTF，確認傾斜與去中心在公差內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the transmitted wavefront with a wafer-level interferometer or Shack–Hartmann sensor, look for a step at the stitch line, convert it to displacement and compare with pillar displacement measured directly by SEM; at module level, measure MTF across the field with a target to confirm tilt and decentre are within tolerance. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：切割後的晶粒若以黏著劑固定，固化收縮使透鏡傾斜 0.5°，高 NA 焦點出現不對稱慧差，影像單側模糊；而晶圓級量測因在切割前完成而未能攔截。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A diced die fixed with adhesive can tilt by 0.5° as the adhesive cures, producing asymmetric coma at a high-NA focus and one-sided blur; wafer-level metrology done before dicing cannot intercept it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以晶圓級干涉儀或 Shack–Hartmann 量穿透波前，在拼接線位置尋找台階並換算為位移，與 SEM 直接量得的柱位移比對；模組端用 MTF 靶量各視場的 MTF，確認傾斜與去中心在公差內。","textEn":"Measure the transmitted wavefront with a wafer-level interferometer or Shack–Hartmann sensor, look for a step at the stitch line, convert it to displacement and compare with pillar displacement measured directly by SEM; at module level, measure MTF across the field with a target to confirm tilt and decentre are within tolerance.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment\"?","options":["以晶圓級干涉儀或 Shack–Hartmann 量穿透波前，在拼接線位置尋找台階並換算為位移，與 SEM 直接量得的柱位移比對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the transmitted wavefront with a wafer-level interferometer or Shack–Hartmann sensor, look for a step at the stitch line, convert it to displacement and compare with pillar displacement measured directly by SEM.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以晶圓級干涉儀或 Shack–Hartmann 量穿透波前，在拼接線位置尋找台階並換算為位移，與 SEM 直接量得的柱位移比對；模組端用 MTF 靶量各視場的 MTF，確認傾斜與去中心在公差內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the transmitted wavefront with a wafer-level interferometer or Shack–Hartmann sensor, look for a step at the stitch line, convert it to displacement and compare with pillar displacement measured directly by SEM; at module level, measure MTF across the field with a target to confirm tilt and decentre are within tolerance. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a417-v12-28","title":"晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「DUV 場拼接線與背面增透層」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “DUV field-stitch line and backside AR layer” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"切割後的晶粒若以黏著劑固定，固化收縮使透鏡傾斜 0.5°，高 NA 焦點出現不對稱慧差，影像單側模糊；而晶圓級量測因在切割前完成而未能攔截。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A diced die fixed with adhesive can tilt by 0.5° as the adhesive cures, producing asymmetric coma at a high-NA focus and one-sided blur; wafer-level metrology done before dicing cannot intercept it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：DUV 步進機的場拼接線會穿過大口徑透鏡，拼接位移等於在該線兩側加一個相位台階，其大小由局部相位梯度決定；模組對位則由透鏡傾斜造成的慧差與去中心造成的影像偏移決定公差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Stepper field boundaries cross a large-aperture lens, and a stitching displacement equals a phase step across that line whose size is set by the local phase gradient; module alignment tolerances come from the coma induced by lens tilt and the image shift induced by decentre.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平面透鏡沒有曲面，所以對傾斜與去中心不敏感。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A flat lens has no curved surface, so it is insensitive to tilt and decentre.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"切割後的晶粒若以黏著劑固定，固化收縮使透鏡傾斜 0.5°，高 NA 焦點出現不對稱慧差，影像單側模糊；而晶圓級量測因在切割前完成而未能攔截。","textEn":"A diced die fixed with adhesive can tilt by 0.5° as the adhesive cures, producing asymmetric coma at a high-NA focus and one-sided blur; wafer-level metrology done before dicing cannot intercept it.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「晶圓級整合、拼接與模組對位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wafer-level integration, stitching and module alignment\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","切割後的晶粒若以黏著劑固定，固化收縮使透鏡傾斜 0.5°，高 NA 焦點出現不對稱慧差，影像單側模糊；而晶圓級量測因在切割前完成而未能攔截。","平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A diced die fixed with adhesive can tilt by 0.5° as the adhesive cures, producing asymmetric coma at a high-NA focus and one-sided blur.","Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging."],"answer":1,"explanation":"切割後的晶粒若以黏著劑固定，固化收縮使透鏡傾斜 0.5°，高 NA 焦點出現不對稱慧差，影像單側模糊；而晶圓級量測因在切割前完成而未能攔截。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A diced die fixed with adhesive can tilt by 0.5° as the adhesive cures, producing asymmetric coma at a high-NA focus and one-sided blur; wafer-level metrology done before dicing cannot intercept it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a417-v12-29","title":"關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」如何決定超穎透鏡製程研究的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package” determines the key performance of “Metalens fabrication research”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"超穎透鏡的品質最終由每根柱子的直徑誤差決定，因為相位庫把直徑映射成相位，直徑的隨機誤差直接變成波前的隨機誤差。交接文件必須把設計相位圖、量測的 CD 分佈、側壁角、穿透相位驗證、效率對波長曲線、PSF/MTF 與環境測試連成一條可追溯的鏈，讓製程端知道哪個參數的漂移會先讓 Strehl 低於 0.8。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The quality of a metalens is ultimately fixed by the diameter error of every pillar, because the library maps diameter to phase and random diameter error becomes random wavefront error directly. The handoff package must chain the design phase map, measured CD distribution, sidewall angle, transmitted-phase verification, efficiency-versus-wavelength curve, PSF/MTF and environmental tests into one traceable record so the process side knows which parameter drift pushes Strehl below 0.8 first. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：相位庫以直徑 80→200 nm 覆蓋 2π，平均斜率 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm；關鍵尺寸標準差 3 nm 給出 σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad，Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976；σ_CD = 10 nm 時 σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad，Strehl ≈ 0.76，低於 0.8 的驗收門檻。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The library covers 2π over diameters 80→200 nm, a mean slope of 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm; a 3 nm CD standard deviation gives σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad and Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976, while σ_CD = 10 nm gives σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad and Strehl ≈ 0.76, below 0.8.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-29-k1","title":"關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接","titleEn":"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff","text":"超穎透鏡的品質最終由每根柱子的直徑誤差決定，因為相位庫把直徑映射成相位，直徑的隨機誤差直接變成波前的隨機誤差。交接文件必須把設計相位圖、量測的 CD 分佈、側壁角、穿透相位驗證、效率對波長曲線、PSF/MTF 與環境測試連成一條可追溯的鏈，讓製程端知道哪個參數的漂移會先讓 Strehl 低於 0.8。","textEn":"The quality of a metalens is ultimately fixed by the diameter error of every pillar, because the library maps diameter to phase and random diameter error becomes random wavefront error directly. The handoff package must chain the design phase map, measured CD distribution, sidewall angle, transmitted-phase verification, efficiency-versus-wavelength curve, PSF/MTF and environmental tests into one traceable record so the process side knows which parameter drift pushes Strehl below 0.8 first.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。","只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","超穎透鏡的品質最終由每根柱子的直徑誤差決定，因為相位庫把直徑映射成相位，直徑的隨機誤差直接變成波前的隨機誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging.","As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","The quality of a metalens is ultimately fixed by the diameter error of every pillar, because the library maps diameter to phase and random diameter error becomes random wavefront error directly."],"answer":2,"explanation":"超穎透鏡的品質最終由每根柱子的直徑誤差決定，因為相位庫把直徑映射成相位，直徑的隨機誤差直接變成波前的隨機誤差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The quality of a metalens is ultimately fixed by the diameter error of every pillar, because the library maps diameter to phase and random diameter error becomes random wavefront error directly. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a417-v12-30","title":"關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：相位庫以直徑 80→200 nm 覆蓋 2π，平均斜率 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm；關鍵尺寸標準差 3 nm 給出 σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad，Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976；σ_CD = 10 nm 時 σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad，Strehl ≈ 0.76，低於 0.8 的驗收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The library covers 2π over diameters 80→200 nm, a mean slope of 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm; a 3 nm CD standard deviation gives σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad and Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976, while σ_CD = 10 nm gives σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad and Strehl ≈ 0.76, below 0.8. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在晶圓中心、半徑中點與邊緣各取五個位置做 CD-SEM 統計，算出 σ_CD 並換算 Strehl 預測值，與每顆透鏡實測的 Strehl 做散佈圖；若相關性弱，表示主導誤差來自側壁角或材料折射率而非 CD，應更新預算表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take CD-SEM statistics at five sites each at wafer centre, mid-radius and edge, convert σ_CD into a predicted Strehl and plot it against the measured Strehl of each lens; weak correlation means the dominant error is sidewall angle or material index rather than CD, and the budget table must be updated.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"相位庫以直徑 80→200 nm 覆蓋 2π，平均斜率 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm；關鍵尺寸標準差 3 nm 給出 σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad，Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976；σ_CD = 10 nm 時 σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad，Strehl ≈ 0.76，低於 0.8 的驗收門檻。","textEn":"The library covers 2π over diameters 80→200 nm, a mean slope of 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm; a 3 nm CD standard deviation gives σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad and Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976, while σ_CD = 10 nm gives σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad and Strehl ≈ 0.76, below 0.8.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["相位庫以直徑 80→200 nm 覆蓋 2π，平均斜率 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm。","電子束微影解析度高，所以也是量產超穎透鏡的最佳方法。","穿透率 95% 就代表聚焦效率 95%。"],"optionsEn":["The library covers 2π over diameters 80→200 nm, a mean slope of 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm.","Electron-beam lithography has the best resolution, so it is also the best way to mass-produce metalenses.","A transmittance of 95% means a focusing efficiency of 95%."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相位庫以直徑 80→200 nm 覆蓋 2π，平均斜率 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm；關鍵尺寸標準差 3 nm 給出 σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad，Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976；σ_CD = 10 nm 時 σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad，Strehl ≈ 0.76，低於 0.8 的驗收門檻。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The library covers 2π over diameters 80→200 nm, a mean slope of 2π/120 nm ≈ 0.052 rad/nm; a 3 nm CD standard deviation gives σ_φ ≈ 0.16 rad and Strehl ≈ exp(−σ_φ²) ≈ 0.976, while σ_CD = 10 nm gives σ_φ ≈ 0.52 rad and Strehl ≈ 0.76, below 0.8. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a417-v12-31","title":"關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在晶圓中心、半徑中點與邊緣各取五個位置做 CD-SEM 統計，算出 σ_CD 並換算 Strehl 預測值，與每顆透鏡實測的 Strehl 做散佈圖；若相關性弱，表示主導誤差來自側壁角或材料折射率而非 CD，應更新預算表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take CD-SEM statistics at five sites each at wafer centre, mid-radius and edge, convert σ_CD into a predicted Strehl and plot it against the measured Strehl of each lens; weak correlation means the dominant error is sidewall angle or material index rather than CD, and the budget table must be updated. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：交接時只附效率平均值而沒有 CD 地圖與側壁角，下一批製程微調後 Strehl 從 0.95 掉到 0.7，卻無法判斷是曝光劑量、蝕刻還是 ALD 折射率漂移所致。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A handoff that reports only mean efficiency without the CD map and sidewall angle leaves the next batch, after a process tweak, with Strehl falling from 0.95 to 0.7 and no way to tell whether exposure dose, etch or ALD index drifted.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在晶圓中心、半徑中點與邊緣各取五個位置做 CD-SEM 統計，算出 σ_CD 並換算 Strehl 預測值，與每顆透鏡實測的 Strehl 做散佈圖；若相關性弱，表示主導誤差來自側壁角或材料折射率而非 CD，應更新預算表。","textEn":"Take CD-SEM statistics at five sites each at wafer centre, mid-radius and edge, convert σ_CD into a predicted Strehl and plot it against the measured Strehl of each lens; weak correlation means the dominant error is sidewall angle or material index rather than CD, and the budget table must be updated.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在晶圓中心、半徑中點與邊緣各取五個位置做 CD-SEM 統計，算出 σ_CD 並換算 Strehl 預測值，與每顆透鏡實測的 Strehl 做散佈圖。","超穎透鏡很薄，所以色差比玻璃透鏡小。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Take CD-SEM statistics at five sites each at wafer centre, mid-radius and edge, convert σ_CD into a predicted Strehl and plot it against the measured Strehl of each lens.","A metalens is thin, so its chromatic aberration is smaller than a glass lens."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在晶圓中心、半徑中點與邊緣各取五個位置做 CD-SEM 統計，算出 σ_CD 並換算 Strehl 預測值，與每顆透鏡實測的 Strehl 做散佈圖；若相關性弱，表示主導誤差來自側壁角或材料折射率而非 CD，應更新預算表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take CD-SEM statistics at five sites each at wafer centre, mid-radius and edge, convert σ_CD into a predicted Strehl and plot it against the measured Strehl of each lens; weak correlation means the dominant error is sidewall angle or material index rather than CD, and the budget table must be updated. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a417-v12-32","title":"關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"prerequisiteIds":["a417-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「CD 均勻性地圖與驗收數據包」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “CD-uniformity map and acceptance data package” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"交接時只附效率平均值而沒有 CD 地圖與側壁角，下一批製程微調後 Strehl 從 0.95 掉到 0.7，卻無法判斷是曝光劑量、蝕刻還是 ALD 折射率漂移所致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A handoff that reports only mean efficiency without the CD map and sidewall angle leaves the next batch, after a process tweak, with Strehl falling from 0.95 to 0.7 and no way to tell whether exposure dose, etch or ALD index drifted. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件必須把設計相位圖、量測的 CD 分佈、側壁角、穿透相位驗證、效率對波長曲線、PSF/MTF 與環境測試連成一條可追溯的鏈，讓製程端知道哪個參數的漂移會先讓 Strehl 低於 0.8。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff package must chain the design phase map, measured CD distribution, sidewall angle, transmitted-phase verification, efficiency-versus-wavelength curve, PSF/MTF and environmental tests into one traceable record so the process side knows which parameter drift pushes Strehl below 0.8 first.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均直徑對了就夠，直徑的散佈不影響成像。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Getting the mean diameter right is enough; diameter scatter does not affect imaging.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a417-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"交接時只附效率平均值而沒有 CD 地圖與側壁角，下一批製程微調後 Strehl 從 0.95 掉到 0.7，卻無法判斷是曝光劑量、蝕刻還是 ALD 折射率漂移所致。","textEn":"A handoff that reports only mean efficiency without the CD map and sidewall angle leaves the next batch, after a process tweak, with Strehl falling from 0.95 to 0.7 and no way to tell whether exposure dose, etch or ALD index drifted.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]},{"id":"a417-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「關鍵尺寸預算與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Critical-dimension budget and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","只要相位值算對，取樣格點多密並不重要。","交接時只附效率平均值而沒有 CD 地圖與側壁角，下一批製程微調後 Strehl 從 0.95 掉到 0.7，卻無法判斷是曝光劑量、蝕刻還是 ALD 折射率漂移所致。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","As long as the phase values are right, the sampling pitch does not matter.","A handoff that reports only mean efficiency without the CD map and sidewall angle leaves the next batch, after a process tweak, with Strehl falling from 0.95 to 0.7 and no way to tell whether exposure dose, etch or ALD index drifted."],"answer":2,"explanation":"交接時只附效率平均值而沒有 CD 地圖與側壁角，下一批製程微調後 Strehl 從 0.95 掉到 0.7，卻無法判斷是曝光劑量、蝕刻還是 ALD 折射率漂移所致。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A handoff that reports only mean efficiency without the CD map and sidewall angle leaves the next batch, after a process tweak, with Strehl falling from 0.95 to 0.7 and no way to tell whether exposure dose, etch or ALD index drifted. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-harvard-seas-metalens-stars","v12o-nist-nanofab-jbx6300","v12o-nilt-meta-optics","v12o-st-metalenz-press-2022"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
